dialogue swamp_party_talk
title: The manifest
trigger: ThemeStart swamp
speaker commander $commander
speaker trusted $trusted
speaker enchantress - name=Enchantress portrait=whitewitch

node a commander
  That door opened for me when none of you could force it. And I remember names being called for boarding. Mine wasn't one of them.
  -> b

node b enchantress
  Halcyon's Arks. The manifest says they sailed the night the city fell, and the tides threw them here. Halcyon tried to run. And a door that knows your hand is news the Choir will hear. They'll hunt you now, not just the wagon.
  * They'll hunt you too, for riding with me. You can still walk away. -> speak
    if: TrustAtLeast $trusted 25
  * Let them hunt. We keep the wagon moving.

node speak trusted
  Walk away to what? A hold that pays the tithe and waits for the wagons? I followed you before that door ever opened. The Choir caring about it doesn't change much.
  * It changes one thing. When they come for me, I want you at my back. -> back
    do: AddTrust $trusted 6
  * Then stay. I'll try to make it worth the danger. -> worth
    do: AddTrust $trusted 3

node back trusted
  At your back. That's where I'd have been anyway.

node worth trusted
  Don't promise that. Just don't make me regret it.
